FAN Connectors
==============

|Product| supports 4 pin fan header as shown in the figure below.

.. rst-class:: text-center

   .. image:: /Media/NVIDIA/Jetson-Orin-Nano_NX/CS12800-JETORIN-101/CS12800-JETORIN-101-FAN.png
      :align: center
      :width: 200

   *FAN Connectors*

It serves as an external fan interface for connecting an off board fan, supporting PWM speed control and tachometer speed monitoring.
Check the below table to know the pin description.

.. table:: 4Pin Fan Connector Pinout
    :widths: 8, 22, 45

    +------+---------------------+----------------------------------------+
    | Pin  | Net Name            | Description                            |
    +======+=====================+========================================+
    | 1    | GND                 | Power ground                           |
    +------+---------------------+----------------------------------------+
    | 2    | VDD_12V             | 12V fan power supply positive          |
    +------+---------------------+----------------------------------------+
    | 3    | TACH (FAN_TACH)     | Fan tachometer speed feedback signal   |
    +------+---------------------+----------------------------------------+
    | 4    | PWM (FAN_PWM)       | Fan speed PWM control signal           |
    +------+---------------------+----------------------------------------+
   
